<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Your completion pack, Helen</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Your certificate, invoice, warranties and signed forms. Keep this email, it's handy if you sell your home.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Your completion pack, Helen</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Everything about your new ceiling insulation in one place. Keep this email. It's handy if you sell your home or need your warranty.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow" padding="18px 18px 4px">Installed</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 16px"><strong>Ceiling insulation — Bradford Gold Ceiling Batt R5.0 — 137.6 m²</strong><br /><span class="muted">ESC model 467911</span></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-table padding="6px 18px 6px">
            <tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 0;"><strong>&#128196; Certificate of Completion</strong><br /><span class="muted">Product, R-value, area, installer, date and rebate</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:12px 0 12px 12px;white-space:nowrap;"><span class="muted">On your job page</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><strong>&#128196; Tax invoice</strong><br /><span class="muted">Paid in full</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:12px 0 12px 12px;white-space:nowrap;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><span class="muted">On your job page</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><strong>&#128196; Your warranties</strong><br /><span class="muted">1-year installer workmanship · 5-year product warranty</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:12px 0 12px 12px;white-space:nowrap;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=done" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Download</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><strong>&#128196; Signed forms</strong><br /><span class="muted">Acceptance, install consent, rebate form, safety check</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:12px 0 12px 12px;white-space:nowrap;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=done" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Download</a></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">Something not right?</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 14px;"><span class="num">1</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Contact your installer first</strong><br /><span class="muted">Sample Insulation Co · 0400 000 000. Workmanship is covered for 1 year.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 14px;"><span class="num">2</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Not sorted? Contact us</strong><br /><span class="muted">Reply to this email and we'll help sort it out.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 12px;"><span class="num">3</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Still not resolved?</strong><br /><span class="muted">You can contact the Essential Services Commission, which runs the VEU program.</span></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">Looking after your insulation</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Don't move, squash or walk on the batts. They work best fluffed up.</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">If a tradie works in your ceiling, ask them to put the insulation back as they found it.</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Adding new downlights later? Make sure they're IC-rated. That means they're safe to cover with insulation.</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="14px 12px 0">Thanks for choosing Home Insulation Victoria. Your pack is always on your job page too.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
